%% Actor ordering per .lovable/spec/commands/03-diagram-actor-ordering.md
%% Companion JSON: ./quota-approval-flow.json
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Reseller as Reseller UI
    participant Admin as Admin UI
    participant API as Lara API
    participant DB as Split-DB
    participant Audit as AuditLog

    Note over Reseller,API: 1. Request submission
    Reseller->>API: POST /QuotaRequests { LicenseCategoryId, LicenseTierId, RequestedDelta, Justification } <br/> Idempotency-Key
    API->>DB: BEGIN, SELECT QuotaRequests WHERE Status=Pending (tuple lock), assert none exists, INSERT QuotaRequests, COMMIT
    API->>Audit: QuotaRequestSubmitted
    API-->>Reseller: 201 { QuotaRequestId, Status Pending }

    Note over Admin,API: 2. Admin Decision (Approve)
    Admin->>API: POST /QuotaRequests/{Id}/Approve { ApprovedDelta } <br/> Idempotency-Key
    API->>DB: BEGIN
    API->>DB: SELECT QuotaRequests FOR UPDATE (Status=Pending)
    API->>DB: SELECT ResellerQuotas FOR UPDATE (Allowance path)
    API->>DB: UPDATE ResellerQuotas (LicensesGranted += ApprovedDelta)
    API->>DB: INSERT ResellerQuotaLedger (Delta = ApprovedDelta, Action = QuotaAdjusted)
    API->>DB: UPDATE QuotaRequests (Status=Approved, ApprovedDelta, DecidedBy)
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API->>Audit: QuotaRequestApproved
    API-->>Admin: 200 { QuotaRequestId, Status Approved }

    Note over Admin,API: 3. Admin Decision (Deny)
    Admin->>API: POST /QuotaRequests/{Id}/Deny { DenialReason } <br/> Idempotency-Key
    API->>DB: BEGIN, UPDATE QuotaRequests (Status=Denied, DenialReason, DecidedBy), COMMIT
    API->>Audit: QuotaRequestDenied
    API-->>Admin: 200 { QuotaRequestId, Status Denied }

    Note over Reseller,API: 4. Reseller Cancellation
    Reseller->>API: POST /QuotaRequests/{Id}/Cancel <br/> Idempotency-Key
    API->>DB: BEGIN, UPDATE QuotaRequests (Status=Cancelled) WHERE Status=Pending, COMMIT
    API-->>Reseller: 200 { QuotaRequestId, Status Cancelled }
